<p>
<img src="bestof_cover.jpg">
<p>     
		You may have seen Bis pop-up on listings for gigs. The reason is that we've decided to do some reunion gigs for the 10 year anniversary of The New Transistor Heroes, our first album. The dates for the reunion shows are -</p><p>
		5th April - Glasgow, King Tuts Wah Wah Hut<br>
		6th April - London, Islington Academy<br>
		7th April - Manchester, Satan's Hollow</p>
		<p>
		Tickets are selling fast, but you can still buy them from -</p><p>
	<a href="http://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/event/17003D77E274DF7C?camefrom=CFC_UKAFF_VID2_VIDEO&m3_data=ej04MzN8cD0yNTQzfGE9NTU1Ng&brand=uk_videoc">Ticketmaster (Glasgow)</a><br>
		<a href="http://www.ticketweb.co.uk/user/?region=gb_london&query=detail&event=189021&interface=islingacad">Ticketweb (London)</a><br>
				<a href="http://www.ticketline.co.uk/a-z.php?id=6671359">Ticketline (Manchester)</a></p>
<p>	The greatest hits (we are Bis from Glasgow, Scotland) will hopefully be on sale by the start of April, in time for the gigs.  The lovely Cherry Red records are releasing it.  It will feature tunes:</p><p>
		01. kandy pop<br>
		02. eurodisco<br>
		03. kill yr boyfriend<br>
		04. starbright boy<br>
		05. i'm a slut<br>
		06. action and drama<br>
		07. sweet shop avengerz<br>
		08. school disco<br>
		09. monstarr<br>
		10. this is fake d.i.y<br>
		11. tell it to the kids<br>
		12. secret vampires<br>
		13. icky-poo air raid<br>
		14. i want it all<br>
		15. the end starts today<br>
